1
00:00:00,801 --> 00:00:02,801
[SIGHING]

2
00:00:15,733 --> 00:00:17,563
(Sheldon:)Morning, old chum.

3
00:00:17,735 --> 00:00:20,575
(Leonard:)-What's going on?
-I've made you breakfast.

4
00:00:20,738 --> 00:00:22,568
(Sheldon:)Juice, coffee...

5
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,620
(Sheldon:)...and pancakes in the shape of some
of your favorite fictional characters.

6
00:00:26,786 --> 00:00:28,746
(Sheldon:)See, here's Frodo.

7
00:00:28,913 --> 00:00:31,833
(Leonard:)-You made Frodo pancakes?
-Yeah, I used coconut shavings...

8
00:00:31,999 --> 00:00:33,959
(Sheldon:)...to do the hair on his feet.

9
00:00:34,293 --> 00:00:36,963
(Sheldon:)If you need to void your bladder
before eating...

10
00:00:37,129 --> 00:00:40,589
(Sheldon:)...I can keep them warm with this beret
that I thoroughly laundered...

11
00:00:40,758 --> 00:00:43,598
(Sheldon:)...and pressed into service
as a pancake cozy.

12
00:00:44,595 --> 00:00:46,095
(Leonard:)Why are you doing this?

13
00:00:46,681 --> 00:00:49,181
(Sheldon:)It's by way of an apology
for my recent behavior.

14
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:53,100
(Sheldon:)I've had some time to reflect
and I've come to realize...

15
00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:56,270
(Sheldon:)...that friendship is not an aggregation
of written agreements.

16
00:00:56,440 --> 00:01:00,780
It's the result of two people
respecting and caring for each other.

